==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**2 [[Ackey]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**6 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**12 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**4 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]] can be extremely useful for this stage, able to rush down both Ackey and Fallen Bear and shatter their [[Shield|Aku Shields]], but they aren't a free win. [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]] can use [[Wave Attack|Waves]] to eliminate most of the peons, but [[Surge Attack|Death Surges]] can quickly become a major threat; any [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge Immune units]] will be very helpful. [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]] in particular works as a decent Meatshield, though they won't often be able to get their [[Knockback]] off.

